{"3301040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FANTATALE", "steam_appid": 3301040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FANTATALE Grand Opening - 11/12!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this game matches your style, don’t forget to add it to your WHISHLIST!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep following us for the latest news and updates. You won’t want to miss what’s coming next!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, Lv up, Decorate! The moment when every fantasy becomes reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, your own special adventure begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/3cae1ccdeecd166707bfff13adbfd031.poster.avif?t=1780370636\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/3cae1ccdeecd166707bfff13adbfd031.webm?t=1780370636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/3cae1ccdeecd166707bfff13adbfd031.mp4?t=1780370636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Lv up to strengthen your CHARACTER]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ever-changing boss patterns and dynamic combat situations on every floor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide with weapon swaps, and claim thrilling victories through strategy and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rush of battle and step onto a stage of endless challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/f376dfe4d0367969d8be4815dff8aa03.poster.avif?t=1780370636\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"http